OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA grey start in the west with
OL,6,Flow cloud, mist and fog but much
OL,7,Fclearer in the east. Widely fine with
OL,8,Fgood sunny spells once the low cloud
OL,9,Fbreaks. Cloud builds late in the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Very warm in the sun.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud continues to increase
OL,13,Fand rain develops through the evening.
OL,14,FRain clears overnight but cloud
OL,15,Flingering for many into Saturday. A
OL,16,Fmilder night for most, but cool where
OL,17,Fskies clear.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
