OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAny lingering overnight
OL,6,Fcloud breaks through the morning to
OL,7,Fleave a fine, dry day with good sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Feeling pleasant in the
OL,9,Fsunshine with light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FAfter a
OL,12,Ffine, partly cloudy morning, rain
OL,13,Fmoves through late on Sunday. A
OL,14,Fpleasant day on Monday before turning
OL,15,Fincreasingly windy on Tuesday with
OL,16,Ffurther rain possible. Near average
OL,17,Ftemperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
